" end="00:09.292">need </span><span begin="00:09.292" end="00:09.972">much </span><span begin="00:09.972" end="00:10.189">of </span><span begin="00:10.189" end="00:11.336">anything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.115" end="00:14.461"><span begin="00:12.115" end="00:12.834">But </span><span begin="00:12.834" end="00:13.647">suddenly </span><span begin="00:13.647" end="00:14.460">suddenly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.490" end="00:19.345"><span begin="00:16.490" end="00:16.985">I </span><span begin="00:16.985" end="00:17.233">am </span><span begin="00:17.233" end="00:18.024">small </span><span begin="00:18.024" end="00:18.208">and </span><span begin="00:18.208" end="00:18.352">the </span><span begin="00:18.352" end="00:18.600">world </span><span begin="00:18.600" end="00:19.004">is </span><span begin="00:19.004" end="00:19.342">big</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.077" end="00:23.634"><span begin="00:20.077" end="00:20.537">All </span><span begin="00:20.537" end="00:20.810">around </span><span begin="00:20.810" end="00:22.065">me </span><span begin="00:22.065" end="00:22.250">is </span><span begin="00:22.250" end="00:22.785">fast </span><span begin="00:22.785" end="00:23.631">moving</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.583" end="00:26.883"><span begin="00:24.583" end="00:25.083">Surrounded </span><span begin="00:25.083" end="00:26.163">by </span><span begin="00:26.163" end="00:26.363">so </span><span begin="00:26.363" end="00:26.539">many </span><span begin="00:26.539" end="00:26.874">things</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.712" end="00:30.231"><span begin="00:28.712" end="00:30.020">Suddenly </span><span begin="00:30.020" end="00:30.222">suddenly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.732" end="00:32.985"><span begin="00:31.732" end="00:32.223">How </span><span begin="00:32.223" end="00:32.408">does </span><span begin="00:32.408" end="00:32.701">it </span><span begin="00:32.701" end="00:32.985">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.265" end="00:38.253"><span begin="00:34.265" end="00:34.829">To </span><span begin="00:34.829" end="00:37.036">be </span><span begin="00:37.036" end="00:37.244">different </span><span begin="00:37.244" end="00:37.536">from </span><span begin="00:37.536" end="00:38.251">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.677" end="00:39.837"><span begin="00:38.677" end="00:39.145">Are </span><span begin="00:39.145" end="00:39.318">we </span><span begin="00:39.318" end="00:39.662">the </span><span begin="00:39.662" end="00:39.836">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.871" end="00:42.001"><span begin="00:39.871" end="00:40.361">How </span><span begin="00:40.361" end="00:40.544">does </span><span begin="00:40.544" end="00:40.801">it </span><span begin="00:40.801" end="00:41.995">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.283" end="00:46.320"><span begin="00:42.283" end="00:42.824">To </span><span begin="00:42.824" end="00:45.200">be </span><span begin="00:45.200" end="00:45.704">different </span><span begin="00:45.704" end="00:45.976">from </span><span begin="00:45.976" end="00:46.311">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.766" end="00:47.812"><span begin="00:46.766" end="00:47.236">Are </span><span begin="00:47.236" end="00:47.395">we </span><span begin="00:47.395" end="00:47.567">the </span><span begin="00:47.567" end="00:47.811">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.996" end="00:49.969"><span begin="00:47.996" end="00:48.473">How </span><span begin="00:48.473" end="00:48.657">does </span><span begin="00:48.657" end="00:48.976">it </span><span begin="00:48.976" end="00:49.960">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.112" end="00:57.861"><span begin="00:57.112" end="00:57.566">I </span><span begin="00:57.566" end="00:57.750">am </span><span begin="00:57.750" end="00:57.853">young</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.382" end="01:00.223"><span begin="00:58.382" end="00:58.839">And </span><span begin="00:58.839" end="00:59.016">